# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (MEADOW_START=level): one thumb holds the d-pad right while the
# other presses A to jump. Touches go through the same hit testing as fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by the
# phone checks.
120 capture touch_start.png
130 touch 1 dpad 0.8 0
170 touch 2 jump
185 lift 2
190 capture touch_jump.png
240 lift 1
270 capture touch_end.png
290 quit
